### **Option 2: Load động từ Database**

**Tạo `TopMenuController`:**
```csharp
public class TopMenuController : Controller
{
    private WebBanHangDienTuEntities db = new WebBanHangDienTuEntities();

    [ChildActionOnly]
    public ActionResult TopCategories()
    {
        var categories = db.tb_DanhMuc
            .Where(dm => dm.HienThi == true && dm.HienThiTrenMenu == true)
            .OrderBy(dm => dm.ThuTu)
            .ToList();
        
        return PartialView("_TopMenu", categories);
    }
}
```

**Trong `_Layout.cshtml`:**
```razor
@Html.Action("TopCategories", "TopMenu")
```

